          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 30.36,
          "end": 34.413,
          "en": "and we need to do this for both players, of course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 35.49,
          "end": 38.43,
          "en": "And inside of this player component, should be,",
